	(text "R5460N212AF: overcharge 4.29 V/cell (release 4.05 V), overdischarge 3.00 V (3.20 V), discharge overcurrent\n0.2 V / (2·RDS(on)): CSD17579Q3A (8.7 mΩ typ @ 10 V) → ≈ 10 A cold, ≈ 7 A hot (12 ms delay); short circuit 1.1 V (300 µs).\nR305/R308 330 Ω (< 1 kΩ) + C315/C316 100 nF filter VDD and VC; R309 1 kΩ (R305 + R309 ≥ 1 kΩ, R309 ≤ 3 kΩ).\nF301 10 A very fast (NANO2) next to the connector: protects the wiring if the protector fails."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 120.65 0)
		(effects
