	(text "SW301 in OFF ties PWR_EN to GND: 3.3 V buck off, and with it\nthe Pi rail (PI_EN pull-up) — the contact sees ≤ 1.8 V.\nON: 86.6k/23.2k divider → start-up ≈ 5.6 V (< 6.0 V protector cut-off\nand < VSYSMIN 7.0 V). Charging works with the robot switched off."
