	)
	(text "Vout = 0.6 V × (1 + 182k/24.0k) = 5.15 V (Pi 5 input 5.0–5.25 V). D-CAP3 at 600 kHz; 98 % max duty (frequency\nfoldback): regulates 5.15 V at 5 A down to ≈ 5.5 V in. L301 2.2 µH (Isat 11 A); valley limit ≥ 6.1 A. Cout 3×47 µF\n(≈ 75 µF effective at 5 V, limit 220 µF incl. C701). EN: pulled to +3V3 (off with the 3.3 V rail = power switch);\nPI_PWR_OFF high (ESP32 GPIO1, held in deep sleep) turns the Pi rail off after the shutdown handshake. PG → U402 P12."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.82 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "34aa255e-1978-5612-8327-583c7e6f9f1f")
	)
