	(text "NOTES\n• VSYS: BQ25798 power-path output (6.0–8.4 V; ≥ 7.0 V with input). Feeds the TB6612 and both bucks.\n• Board GND = pack P− (after Q302). Never tie BAT− to GND except through Q301/Q302.\n• Off-state draw: bucks in shutdown, protector (≈ 4 µA) and BQ25798 battery-only (≈ 17 µA, ADC off).\n• Capacitors with no voltage rating: X7R 50 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
